Abstract: Proposes a scalable non-zero indicator primitive based on Ellen, Lev, Luchangco, and Moir [[ELLM07]], addressing contention bottlenecks in reference counting, reader-writer locking, RCU and hazard-pointer quiescence detection, work-stealing termination detection, and other concurrent-runtime lifetime predicates where the only query of interest is whether a counter is zero.
Date: 2026-05-04
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes
